{"id":"973e8f8c36bdfa9d","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-provable.md","title":"Provable","display":"df-provable — Provable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-provable","aliases":["57-df-provable"],"display":"df-provable — Provable","depends_on":["[[57-df-derivation]]","[[57-df-proof-system]]","[[57-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provable — Provable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"32599757d6ca82d8\" href=\"?note=32599757d6ca82d8\" title=\"57-df-derivation\">57-df-derivation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e4941b4bb46ac821\" href=\"?note=e4941b4bb46ac821\" title=\"57-df-proof-system\">57-df-proof-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定原调用环境中的证明系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\\in S\\text{-}\\mathrm{ProofSys}\">\\(\\mathcal P\\in S\\text{-}\\mathrm{ProofSys}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e4941b4bb46ac821\" href=\"?note=e4941b4bb46ac821\" title=\"57-df-proof-system\">57-df-proof-system</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>；带下标推导见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"32599757d6ca82d8\" href=\"?note=32599757d6ca82d8\" title=\"57-df-derivation\">57-df-derivation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 省略的是这个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>，不默认指任意其他演算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>省略演算下标的原接口保留，但其环境参数现在明示。专门的 Hilbert 关系仍使用自己的下标 H。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"32599757d6ca82d8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"e4941b4bb46ac821","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"e4941b4bb46ac821","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定原调用环境中的证明系统 $\\mathcal P\\in S\\text{-}\\mathrm{ProofSys}$，见 [[57-df-proof-system]]。$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$；带下标推导见 [[57-df-derivation]]。$\\vdash$ 省略的是这个固定的 $\\mathcal P$，不默认指任意其他演算。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"32599757d6ca82d8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hy